# Cautious Survivor, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, you gain 2 life." It is cast on turn 1
# with four Moxen, attacks on turn 3 (no vigilance, so it is tapped) and Bot1 gains exactly 2 life at the second main phase (20 -> 22).
# On Bot2's turn 4 it is still tapped, but it is not Bot1's second main phase (CR 603.2, "your"): no more life is gained. Bot2 takes 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Cautious Survivor
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cautious Survivor.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Cautious Survivor > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cautious Survivor.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 16
Stack.Count = 0
